{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collection of some content from behind scenes of the development of <i><strong>FUMES</strong></i>. It contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>FUMES</i></strong> <strong>Art Book</strong> full of concept arts and silly ideas that are not (yet?) in the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First playable prototypes of <strong><i>FUMES</i></strong>... as bare bones as it can get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUSTMITES </strong>mini game<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GIFs and screenshots from the development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack does not contain any additional in-game content, because we are not really into stuff like this. Buy it only if you really want to support our tiny team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you</strong> for your support, it means a lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>To access this content after downloading browse main game files and look for folder named FUMES - Supporter Pack.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868400?t=1752164663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868400/ac71023e162f23e511655d357da5f169baf18b7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752164663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868400/9652e057a993ae7042ac2b22da890304f9fe3540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752164663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868400/9652e057a993ae7042ac2b22da890304f9fe3540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752164663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_des